ia the gradients over longer simulation steps. For Planar-v0 and uniform-Bunsen cases, iterating the NN and PDE solver for 32 time-steps improves the accuracy by 81.7% and 94% respectively compared to the m = 2 model. For nonUniform-Bunsen32 and nonUniform-Bunsen100, model performance improves by 84.2% and 70.9% respectively, by using m = 32 instead of m = 2 model."
